---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="太阳系探索 | Solar System" description="探索太阳系轨道、天体档案、尺度比较及火星与月球地貌。">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/media/solar-v02/solar.css" />
<section class="sol" id="sol-terminal" aria-label="太阳系探索终端">
<header class="sol-head"><div><p class="sol-kicker">MPC / SOL SYSTEM · SECTOR 04</p><h1>太阳系<span>探索终端</span></h1><p class="sol-muted">HELIOCENTRIC EXPLORATION TERMINAL · 从轨道到地表</p></div><nav class="sol-tabs" aria-label="探索模式"><button data-view="orbit">轨道总览</button><button data-view="viewer">观察舱</button><button data-view="compare">尺度与引力</button><button data-view="surface">地表探索</button></nav></header>
<div class="sol-bar"><span id="sol-mode" aria-live="polite">01 / ORBIT CONTROL</span><details class="sol-controls"><summary>◈ 动效与时间 <span id="sol-motion-label">运行</span></summary><div class="sol-control-inner"><button id="sol-motion" aria-pressed="true">暂停动效</button><label>时间倍率 <select id="sol-rate"><option value="1">1×</option><option value="10">10×</option><option value="50">50×</option><option value="100">100×</option></select></label><button id="sol-reset">重置轨道</button><label>轨道演示 <select id="sol-orbit-mode"><option value="art">艺术节奏</option><option value="science">科学周期</option></select></label></div></details></div>
<div class="sol-workspace"><div class="sol-main">
<section data-panel="orbit" class="sol-panel"><div class="sol-map-header"><span>日心轨道 / ORBITAL MAP</span><div><button id="sol-minus" aria-label="缩小轨道">−</button><button id="sol-plus" aria-label="放大轨道">＋</button><button id="sol-fit">复位</button></div></div><div class="sol-orbit-scroll" id="sol-scroll"><div class="sol-map" id="sol-map"><svg id="sol-tracks" viewBox="0 0 900 540" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"></svg><div id="sol-nodes"></div></div></div><p class="sol-note">轨道距离、天体大小与初始相位均为示意；非实时星历。月球相对地球运行。</p></section>
<section data-panel="viewer" class="sol-panel" hidden><div class="sol-map-header"><span>目标观察 / PLANET VIEWER</span><span id="sol-view-tag"></span></div><div class="sol-viewer"><span class="sol-cross c1"></span><span class="sol-cross c2"></span><div class="sol-planet-stage"><canvas id="sol-planet" width="160" height="160" role="img" aria-label="天体像素示意"></canvas></div><div class="sol-view-caption"><span id="sol-view-name"></span><small>艺术模型 / 非真实颜色 · 自转为视觉演示</small></div></div><div class="sol-archive" id="sol-archive"></div></section>
<section data-panel="compare" class="sol-panel" hidden><div class="sol-map-header"><span>尺度实验 / SCALE LAB</span></div><div class="sol-lab"><div class="sol-pair"><label>天体 A<select id="sol-a"></select></label><label>天体 B<select id="sol-b"></select></label><button id="sol-earth">B = 地球</button></div><div class="sol-compare-stage" id="sol-compare-stage"></div><p id="sol-ratio" class="sol-note"></p><div class="sol-mass"><label>物体质量（kg）<input id="sol-mass" type="number" min="0" max="1000000000" step="0.1" value="70"></label><label>快速调节<input id="sol-mass-slider" type="range" min="0" max="200" value="70"></label></div><div id="sol-comparison"></div><p class="sol-note">F = mg；质量不变。巨行星为参考高度重力，太阳为光球附近参考值，不代表可站立表面。</p></div></section>
<section data-panel="surface" class="sol-panel" hidden><div class="sol-map-header"><span>地貌考察 / SURFACE EXPLORER</span><div><button data-surface="mars">火星</button><button data-surface="moon">月球</button></div></div><div id="sol-terrain" class="sol-terrain" tabindex="0" aria-label="地表艺术示意，可左右拖动"><div id="sol-terrain-inner"><div class="sol-land land-sky"></div><div class="sol-land land-0"></div><div class="sol-land land-1"></div><div class="sol-land land-2"></div><div id="sol-hotspots"></div></div></div><div class="sol-pan"><button id="sol-left">←</button><input id="sol-pan" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="地表平移"><button id="sol-right">→</button><button id="sol-terrain-reset">复位</button></div><p class="sol-note">原始像素美术改编，知识热点为示意，非真实地点复原。拖动或使用滑块浏览。</p><div class="sol-hotlist" id="sol-hotlist"></div><article id="sol-geology" aria-live="polite"></article><button id="sol-back">返回观察舱 ↗</button></section>
</div><aside class="sol-detail"><div class="sol-map-header"><span>目标档案 / TARGET LOCK</span><span class="sol-led"></span></div><div class="sol-detail-inner"><div class="sol-target"><img id="sol-target-img" alt="" width="160" height="160"><div><span id="sol-class"></span><h2 id="sol-name"></h2><p id="sol-en"></p></div></div><p id="sol-desc"></p><dl class="sol-facts" id="sol-facts"></dl><div class="sol-actions"><button id="sol-open-view">进入观察舱 ↗</button><button id="sol-open-surface" hidden>地表探索 ↗</button><button id="sol-open-compare">尺度比较 ↗</button></div><p class="sol-note">科学数据为近似参考值。<a id="sol-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NASA 天体资料 ↗</a></p></div></aside></div>
<section class="sol-selector" aria-label="天体选择"><div class="sol-map-header"><span>天体序列 / CELESTIAL INDEX</span><span>11 OBJECTS · 8 PLANETS</span></div><div id="sol-selector"></div></section><details class="sol-sources"><summary>科学口径、素材署名与参考来源</summary><p>平均直径为体积等效球直径；重力、质量、密度、恒星自转和公转周期均为近似值。负自转周期表示逆行。月球公转周期为绕地球。科学周期演示采用简化圆轨道，不是星历。太阳差速自转，所列值为参考纬度。</p><p><a href="https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/planets/phys_par.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">JPL Planetary Physical Parameters</a> · <a href="https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/planetary/factsheet/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NASA Planetary Fact Sheet</a> · <a href="https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/planetary/factsheet/sunfact.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sun Fact Sheet</a> · <a href="https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/planetary/factsheet/moonfact.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Moon Fact Sheet</a></p><p>背景：Baldur / Foozle（CC0）；水星等八颗天体动画：<a href="https://ciprient.itch.io/pixel-solar-system-planets" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pixel Solar System by CipriEnt</a>（裁切、最近邻缩放、图集转换）；太阳、土星与天王星分层为项目传统程序化绘制。火星地貌：<a href="https://kayillustrations.itch.io/parallax-terrestrial-planet" target="_blank" rel="noopener">kayillustrations</a>，<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>，调色、平铺、分层；月面：<a href="https://mattwalkden.itch.io/lunar-battle-pack" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MattWalkden</a>（CC0），调色、拼接。均为艺术示意。</p></details><footer class="sol-foot"><a href="/galaxy/">← 返回星系图谱</a><a href="/archive/">知识档案 ↗</a><a href="/observatory/">深空观测站 ↗</a></footer></section>
<script is:inline src="/media/solar-v02/solar.js" defer></script>
</SiteLayout>
